--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f395e524722d44617a6d4bfd8d66ee5c, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tsuchigumo
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CharacterDetailsInspector
  karmicMerit: 66
  Tengu: 0
  Destination: 0
  introLines:
  - character_text: "Yoo-hoo Jizo! It\u2019s nice so to see you. "
    baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: And might I add, that cloak makes you look quite dashing...
    baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  finalLines:
  - character_text: "Anyway, can\u2019t you get this whole judging thing over with? Then you and I can have some fun... "
    baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  hellLines:
  - character_text: "You\u2019re no better than Raiko, the samurai who killed me. All just men who think they can do whatever they please."
    baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: "You may be sending me to Hell, but I\u2019ll be back, and I\u2019ll MAKE you regret this. I\u2019ll chop your head off, and eat it too, just like the nineteen hundred and ninety I\u2019ve already eaten.  "
    baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  humanLines:
  - character_text: "Ha! You\u2019re not the first to be bewitched by my good looks."
    baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: "You truly think I\u2019m some innocent girl from Kitayama? If only the samurai who killed me had been as foolish as you."
    baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: Thanks to you, me and my spider children will continue to seduce and eat men for hundreds of years to come.
    baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: Good luck sending souls to their right places. If you were tricked THIS easily, I doubt Enma has much hope for you.
    baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  heavenLines: []
  CharacterNodes:
  - key: IntroductionText
    value:
      character_text: 'I have just the LONGEST story to tell you. But surely it would bore you. '
      nodeID: IntroductionText
      answers:
      - answer_text: "I doubt it. That\u2019s why I\u2019m here, to listen to your story and decide your fate."
        nextID: luscioushair
      - answer_text: "Well, if it\u2019s a long story, perhaps you\u2019re right. But what else is there to do?"
        nextID: plentyoffun
      CountsTowardsEnding: 0
      baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
      mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - key: luscioushair
    value:
      character_text: Very well. If you MUST know, I was minding my own business, combing my beautifully long, luscious hair, when a samurai suddenly attacked me!
      nodeID: IntroductionText
      answers:
      - answer_text: Well, why did he attack you?
        nextID: openeddoor
      - answer_text: "That\u2019s horrible!"
        nextID: nevermind
      CountsTowardsEnding: 0
      baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
      mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - key: plentyoffun
    value:
      character_text: Well, I can think of PLENTY of fun things we can do together....
      nodeID: plentyoffun
      answers:
      - answer_text: (...I don't think she'll give me more information)
        nextID: IntroductionText
      CountsTowardsEnding: 0
      baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
      mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - key: openeddoor
    value:
      character_text: "How should I know? All I was doing was combing my hair.....Jizo, don\u2019t you think my hair is just beautiful?"
      nodeID: openeddoor
      answers:
      - answer_text: '[Keep listening]'
        nextID: openeddoor2
      CountsTowardsEnding: 0
      baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
      mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - key: openeddoor2
    value:
      character_text: 'Sure, I may have opened my door for him. After all, he was just SO handsome. '
      nodeID: openeddoor2
      answers:
      - answer_text: Why do you think you ended up here, in Hell?
        nextID: perfectbuddhist
      CountsTowardsEnding: 0
      baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
      mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - key: nevermind
    value:
      character_text: "Don\u2019t get me started. I wasn\u2019t ready to die! There were still so many handsome men I wanted to....well, never mind about that."
      nodeID: nevermind
      answers:
      - answer_text: Wanted to what?
        nextID: suspicioussilence
      CountsTowardsEnding: 0
      baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
      mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - key: suspicioussilence
    value:
      character_text: ...
      nodeID: suspicioussilence
      answers:
      - answer_text: (I think I've heard enough.)
        nextID: IntroductionText
      CountsTowardsEnding: 0
      baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
      mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - key: perfectbuddhist
    value:
      character_text: Again, how should I know?
      nodeID: perfectbuddhist
      answers:
      - answer_text: '[Keep listening]'
        nextID: perfectbuddhist2
      CountsTowardsEnding: 0
      baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
      mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - key: perfectbuddhist2
    value:
      character_text: Sure, I may have had my fun---if you know what I mean---but other than that, I was the PERFECT Buddhist practitioner.
      nodeID: perfectbuddhist2
      answers:
      - answer_text: '[Keep listening]'
        nextID: perfectbuddhist3
      CountsTowardsEnding: 0
      baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
      mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - key: perfectbuddhist3
    value:
      character_text: "I donated lots of money to the temples in Kitayama Prefecture, where I\u2019m from."
      nodeID: perfectbuddhist3
      answers:
      - answer_text: Hmmm...that is strange. Enma told me that everyone who ends up here ends up here for a reason.
        nextID: beautifulisasin
      - answer_text: 'It seems your story is fairly straightforward, then. Is there anything else you have to share with me? '
        nextID: worthyourwhile
      CountsTowardsEnding: 0
      baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
      mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - key: beautifulisasin
    value:
      character_text: ".... this must be a mistake then. I\u2019ve done nothing bad. Unless being too beautiful is a sin, I shouldn\u2019t be here!"
      nodeID: beautifulisasin
      answers:
      - answer_text: (I think I've heard enough.)
        nextID: IntroductionText
      CountsTowardsEnding: 0
      baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
      mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - key: worthyourwhile
    value:
      character_text: " No, I\u2019ve told you everything I know."
      nodeID: worthyourwhile
      answers:
      - answer_text: '[Keep listening]'
        nextID: worthyourwhile2
      CountsTowardsEnding: 0
      baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
      mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
